sion shall submit its final report to the President and the \nSecretary  of the Interior not later than Septem ber 28,1979.”.\nTH E W H ITE HOUSE, \nA u g u s t 14, 1979.\n[FR Doc. 79-25722  \nFiled 8-15-79; 2:52 pm]  \nBilling code 3195-01-M\n","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_12151.txt","sha256":"2f75655f4fb36b4592252645697ba975fc3bdf1114ee4c6166125861747dd2d0","source":{"line":1640,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"491b0456dacfb8c84fdf643dd90fd9caa2f53e48e11c4c3f124639c13ad1bd72"}}]}
